{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103122434975-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103125627\"/><p>地上遺下血漬。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>荃灣發生高空墮物傷人案。今晨(3日)11時56分，一名女子途經荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓對開，被高處墮下一枝長約5至6米的樹椏擊中頭部。救援人員接報趕至現場，事主陷入昏迷，由救護車送院救治。警員正就事件展開調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:28.269604+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:24:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:36.714246+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:36.714246+00:00","content_hash":"86855119031f5208ff5baeff138bb77a91681e290977ef43dd20b79f954d97e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}